<h2>Trend lines are back</h2>
<p>The watchlist mini charts work again.</p>
<ul>
    <li><strong>Watchlist Trend column fixed.</strong> Yahoo changed the format of its batched price history, so the 1-month sparklines stayed empty. They load again, and StockDock no longer re-requests them on every refresh. Thanks to Mo (@hamidi-dev) for the fix.</li>
</ul>
